            "review_title": "Review at Nha Hang Hong Hanh",
            "review_text": "Hanni b\nSingapore, Singapore5 contributions\n0\nA Flavor Bomb with a Size Problem\nNov 2025 • Family\nThis creates a genuine dilemma. The food is so incredibly good, you want to try everything. But unless you are a competitive eater or have a family of six with you, it's physically impossible.\n\nWe left feeling a pang of guilt and regret guilt for the food we couldn't finish (despite our best efforts), and regret that we couldn't order more dishes to taste because we were defeated by the first wave.\n\nTaste: 10/10 | Practicality for Small Groups: 6/10\n\nA must-visit for its unparalleled authenticity and explosive flavors. However, I am begging the owners on behalf of all small eaters and adventurous foodies, Please, offer smaller, half-portions!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten November 5, 2025",
