            "review_text": "Jonathan Y\nSeattle, Washington67 contributions\n0\nOn Celebrity Cruise? Visit this classy restaurant for authentic local cuisine and vibes.\nFeb 2024 • Friends\nCelebrity cruise to this fascinating popular local first class restaurant with local Halong cuisine and vibes. They obviously cater to local clientele and thus all struggle with English. Moreover, their menu has no pictures. \n\nWe googled the restaurant : Nha Hang Hong Hanh 3, and found many photos of dishes they served past customers. Together with google translate, we were able to order a great lunch. Prices are cheap, food great. \n\nThere is free shuttle service from ship to the Halong Bay International Cruise Port. It is with the handlers of these golf cart like shuttle that we arranged transport to restsurant at very reasonable price. Its actually walkable but we were lazy.\nRead more\nWritten March 19, 2024",
