            "review_text": "Cao Son\nHanoi, Vietnam58 contributions\n0\nFans of fresh seafood should come here\nMar 2024 • Family\nI recently checked out Hong Hanh 3 Restaurant in Baichay, Halong: the food was so fresh. And the best part? The prices were super reasonable.\n\nThe service was quick and efficient, which is always a plus in my book. The restaurant itself had a \"Ok\" design, but still was a step up from some of the other local spots in Halong. Plus, it’s conveniently located near Sun Marina if you’re planning on cruising.\n\nI would definitely recommend Hong Hanh 3 to anyone who loves fresh seafood.\nRead more\nWritten March 2, 2024",
